{
  "file_id": "3576",
  "text_count": 212,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������I've always worried about\nT.K...",
      "_offset": 702,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "I thought, \"If I'm not there,\nT.K can't do anything.\"",
      "_offset": 746,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "But before I'd realized it, T.K\nhad grown up. He doesn't need me\nanymore.",
      "_offset": 803,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "_offset": 880,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Not just T.K. Tai and Sora\nand Mimi and Joe and Izzy...",
      "_offset": 890,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Everyone's changed... but I'm the\nsame as ever!",
      "_offset": 957,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "That's not true, Matt. You've...",
      "_offset": 1005,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "So what am I supposed to be? Am I\nsupposed to just stay like this?",
      "_offset": 1040,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "_offset": 1107,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I can't stay like this... I have\nto get stronger!",
      "_offset": 1117,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Oh ho ho.",
      "_offset": 1167,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Who's there?!",
      "_offset": 1177,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I am Jureimon.",
      "_offset": 1191,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Jureimon?!",
      "_offset": 1206,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "You're with Pinocchimon, aren't\nyou?",
      "_offset": 1217,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Oh, wait right there.",
      "_offset": 1254,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Shut up!",
      "_offset": 1276,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Hold on. I'm not exactly here to\nfight you. Oh ho ho.",
      "_offset": 1285,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Then I don't have any business\nwith you!",
      "_offset": 1339,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "That's not how you should be\ntreating your elders! Oh ho ho.",
      "_offset": 1380,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "\"What am I supposed to be? Am I\nsupposed to just stay like this?\"",
      "_offset": 1441,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It's important to sit down and\ntake a long look into yourself.",
      "_offset": 1507,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Were you listening to that?",
      "_offset": 1570,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "It doesn't matter whether or not I\nwas. There's nothing that I don't\nknow.",
      "_offset": 1598,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Then tell me! What am I supposed\nto do?",
      "_offset": 1673,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Are you sure you want to know? If\nyou want to become stronger, you\nmust improve yourself.",
      "_offset": 1713,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Improve myself...?",
      "_offset": 1803,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Yes... but you have to have\nresolve.",
      "_offset": 1822,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I... I have resolve. So tell me!\nWhat should I do?",
      "_offset": 1859,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "What should I do?",
      "_offset": 1910,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "You must defeat your rival.",
      "_offset": 1928,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "My rival?",
      "_offset": 1956,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Tai's my rival...? Hahaha! I've\nnever thought of him that way, not\neven once!",
      "_offset": 1966,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "But I know. Everything that Tai\nsays or does...",
      "_offset": 2047,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "You always let it bother you...\nThat's how much of an impact he\nhas on you.",
      "_offset": 2098,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "As long as you can't overcome\nthose thoughts, you can't become \ngreater than you are now.",
      "_offset": 2178,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Fight Tai. Shake off your\nuncertain heart and be reborn!",
      "_offset": 2268,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Lies! Don't believe any of that\ntrash! Tai's your friend, isn't\nhe? Don't be fooled!",
      "_offset": 2328,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Y-Yeah... we're friends! You\nseriously think I'm gonna fight my\nown friend?",
      "_offset": 2416,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Oh, he's your friend? You don't\nseem to truly believe that. You\nshouldn't lie to yourself.",
      "_offset": 2492,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "No way...",
      "_offset": 2583,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Camraderie, friends, friendship...\nall of those are fantasies. Am I\nwrong, Matt?",
      "_offset": 2593,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "I... I don't know!",
      "_offset": 2676,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Get it? Go fight Tai if you\nwant to improve yourself.",
      "_offset": 2695,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "If you don't have resolve, you\nwon't be able to change!",
      "_offset": 2752,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I don't know! What should I do...",
      "_offset": 2808,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Why is my Crest the Crest of\nFriendship?",
      "_offset": 2842,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Matt...Okay, Matt. If that's\nwhat you really think, I'll go\nalong with you.",
      "_offset": 2883,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Gabumon...",
      "_offset": 2963,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Tai's way of constantly rushing\ninto things isn't always\nnecessarily the right thing to do.",
      "_offset": 2974,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "There must be something that only\nyou can do, Matt.",
      "_offset": 3069,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Something only I can do...",
      "_offset": 3123,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "We'll find it together! And if the\nonly way to do that is to fight\nfor you...",
      "_offset": 3150,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Then that's exactly what I'll do!",
      "_offset": 3228,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Gabumon...",
      "_offset": 3262,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Even if everyone else becomes your\nenemy, Matt, I'll stay with you!",
      "_offset": 3273,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Gabumon!",
      "_offset": 3343,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Let's go, Matt!",
      "_offset": 3352,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3370,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Lord Pinocchimon... my strategy\nhas succeeded.",
      "_offset": 3376,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Hmmm? What kind of strategy is it?",
      "_offset": 3423,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "A strategy to make the two\nUltimates, WarGreymon and\nMetalGarurumon, fight each other.",
      "_offset": 3458,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Huh, interesting! I've gotta\nhurry, or else I'll miss it!",
      "_offset": 3545,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Be wary of the Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 3603,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "If you underestimate them, even\nyou might lose, Lord Pinocchimon.",
      "_offset": 3635,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "You're saying I might lose?",
      "_offset": 3701,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "They have something you're\nmissing, Lord Pinocchimon...",
      "_offset": 3729,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I'm missing something? You're\nsaying *I'm* the one missing\nsomething?",
      "_offset": 3785,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Yes. That would be...",
      "_offset": 3855,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I'm not missing anything at all!",
      "_offset": 3877,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Gaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3910,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Hmph! I won't forgive anyone who\ntries to make a fool of me.",
      "_offset": 3923,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Heeeeeey, Matt!",
      "_offset": 3984,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Mattooooo!",
      "_offset": 4002,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Tai... What happened with\nMatt?",
      "_offset": 4015,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Like I'd know! Seriously, what's\nup with him?",
      "_offset": 4052,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "What's wrong, Kari?",
      "_offset": 4098,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I heard a voice again.",
      "_offset": 4120,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "A voice? Matt's voice?",
      "_offset": 4143,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "No... it wasn't Matt's voice.",
      "_offset": 4168,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Kari...",
      "_offset": 4200,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "We can't find him. Let's take a\nlittle break.",
      "_offset": 4210,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Geez, where'd Matt go...",
      "_offset": 4256,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Guys, let's take a little break.",
      "_offset": 4283,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "It's the Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 4316,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Who's this?",
      "_offset": 4342,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "_offset": 4354,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4365,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Matt!",
      "_offset": 4379,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Matt! We've all been wondering\nwhere you went!",
      "_offset": 4387,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Gabumon!",
      "_offset": 4436,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "W-Why...",
      "_offset": 4445,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Agumon, I challenge you! Evolve to\nUltimate, now!",
      "_offset": 4454,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "No! Why do I have to fight you?",
      "_offset": 4504,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "What happened to you, Matt?",
      "_offset": 4536,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Hey, Matt! Hurry up and stop\nhim!",
      "_offset": 4566,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "No... I refuse. Now, hurry up and\nevolve to WarGreymon!",
      "_offset": 4602,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "You're serious about this.",
      "_offset": 4658,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Stop joking around! Aren't we your\nfellow Chosen Children?",
      "_offset": 4685,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "\"Fellow\"? Okay, so who's the one\nwho chose us?",
      "_offset": 4744,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 4791,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "If you don't know, then why are\nyou saying I'm one of you?",
      "_offset": 4799,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Don't bother trying to convince\nhim, Joe. He's being stubborn.",
      "_offset": 4858,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Stop this, both of you!",
      "_offset": 4921,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Don't tell that to *me*! Matt's\nthe one who's lashing out.",
      "_offset": 4945,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Whatever, just fight me!",
      "_offset": 5006,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "You're real persistent, Matt.",
      "_offset": 5031,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Tai! Get down!",
      "_offset": 5063,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Stop it! There's no reason for us\nto be fighting!",
      "_offset": 5081,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Maybe you don't have one, but I\ndo!",
      "_offset": 5131,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Feel up to fighting now? Ugh!",
      "_offset": 5167,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Wanna know why I just hit you?",
      "_offset": 5197,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Yeah, you wanna fight, don't you?",
      "_offset": 5228,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Both of you, stop it!",
      "_offset": 5262,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "This punch isn't from me. It's\nfrom everyone who died for us!",
      "_offset": 5284,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Matt... do you think they'd want\nus to be fighting for no reason\nlike this?",
      "_offset": 5346,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "I don't know!",
      "_offset": 5424,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Stooooop! Matt, fighting is bad!",
      "_offset": 5438,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "I can't take this anymore!",
      "_offset": 5473,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Mimi!",
      "_offset": 5500,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "We fight and we fight, and what do\nwe get out of it?! I've had\nenough!",
      "_offset": 5506,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Are you our enemies? Or our\nfriends?",
      "_offset": 5577,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Whom is Kari talking to?",
      "_offset": 5618,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "I don't know.",
      "_offset": 5645,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "I see. So you're not our\nenemies...",
      "_offset": 5659,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Aaaah!",
      "_offset": 5695,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5702,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Izzy!",
      "_offset": 5712,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "W-What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 5723,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Where are we?",
      "_offset": 5743,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "What just happened?",
      "_offset": 5757,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "I am one who wishes for stability\nin the Digital World.",
      "_offset": 5777,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "What are you saying, Kari...?",
      "_offset": 5833,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Kari's not the one talking.",
      "_offset": 5865,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "Someone's using Kari's mouth to\nspeak to us.",
      "_offset": 5895,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "We prepared eight DigiEggs for the\ntime when the world would be\ncovered by the powers of darkness.",
      "_offset": 5942,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "First, from your data, we created\nthe Digivices and the Emblemas.",
      "_offset": 6041,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Which means you're the ones who\nchose us?",
      "_offset": 6105,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Yes. Four years ago, when you met\nthe Digimon for the first time in\nKarigaoka...",
      "_offset": 6147,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "The light around you all was there\nto scan your data.",
      "_offset": 6230,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "And you chose us...",
      "_offset": 6284,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "The Digivices and Emblemas are there \nto properly evolve your Digimon in \naccordance with your natures.",
      "_offset": 6304,
      "_length": 101,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "So... when I made Agumon evolve into\nSkullGreymon...",
      "_offset": 6406,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "It was because I had the wrong\nkind of courage.",
      "_offset": 6459,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "Yes. You've finally realized.",
      "_offset": 6507,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "We've been struggling, trying to\nfind things about ourselves that\nwe had in the first place...",
      "_offset": 6537,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "So, what happened to this world?",
      "_offset": 6632,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "So, what happened to this world?",
      "_offset": 6665,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "The Dark Masters found out about\nour plan, and decided to get in\nour way.",
      "_offset": 6698,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "and decided to get in our way.",
      "_offset": 6772,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "They invaded and tried to steal\nthe Emblemas. He was the one who\nprotected them from Piemon...",
      "_offset": 6803,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Ah! Could that be Gennai?!",
      "_offset": 6896,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "He took the Emblemas and DigiEggs\nand brought them to File Island.",
      "_offset": 6923,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "Unfortunately, due to the\ninterference of his pursuers, he\nlost track of one of them.",
      "_offset": 6988,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "he lost track of one of them.",
      "_offset": 7074,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "he lost track of one of them.",
      "_offset": 7104,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "That was when my DigiEgg got\nseparated from the others...",
      "_offset": 7134,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "And a long, long time passed.",
      "_offset": 7192,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "I remember. I was always\nwaiting... for Tai!",
      "_offset": 7222,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "For Matt!",
      "_offset": 7270,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "For Sora!",
      "_offset": 7282,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "For Joe!",
      "_offset": 7292,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "For Mimi!",
      "_offset": 7301,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "For T.K!",
      "_offset": 7311,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "For Izzy!",
      "_offset": 7323,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "For Izzy!",
      "_offset": 7338,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "The days passed, and then one\nday... I met Tai.",
      "_offset": 7353,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "So that's why. And what are we\nsupposed to do now?",
      "_offset": 7404,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "Right now, even we don't know...",
      "_offset": 7455,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "But I believe that you can figure\nthat out with your own abilities.",
      "_offset": 7488,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "U-Ugh...",
      "_offset": 7556,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "Kari...",
      "_offset": 7565,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "_offset": 7575,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "Thank goodness!",
      "_offset": 7585,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "Kari... About what happened\nearlier...",
      "_offset": 7601,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "What happened earlier?",
      "_offset": 7642,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "Never mind. It's fine if you don't\nremember.",
      "_offset": 7665,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "Matt. So now you know why we're\nthe Chosen Children, right?",
      "_offset": 7710,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 7772,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "We're the only ones who can fix \nthe distortion in this world. So \nlet's work together again!",
      "_offset": 7778,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "Sorry.",
      "_offset": 7872,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "Matt!",
      "_offset": 7879,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "Was I wrong?",
      "_offset": 7887,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "No, all of it was my fault.",
      "_offset": 7900,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "I don't know why I fought you. I\nthought I'd be able to find my own\nway of life if I did...",
      "_offset": 7928,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "I don't think you'll be able to\nforgive me with just an apology,\nbut I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 8020,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "_offset": 8100,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "But I want to find my own way. No,\nI *have* to find it.",
      "_offset": 8110,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "So I'm going to leave and work on\nmy own. Just me and Tsunomon.",
      "_offset": 8166,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "english": "Hey, how about this? We can split\ninto two groups and work from\nthere.",
      "_offset": 8230,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "english": "Sorry... but I have to do this by\nmyself.",
      "_offset": 8301,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "english": "Okay. But I believe you'll be\nfine, Matt.",
      "_offset": 8343,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "english": "Matt... What am I supposed to\ndo...?",
      "_offset": 8387,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "english": "You'll be fine by yourself,\nT.K.",
      "_offset": 8426,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "english": "T.K, Matt wants to think over\nsome stuff by himself. Let him go.",
      "_offset": 8462,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 8532,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "english": "Thanks. All right, see you.",
      "_offset": 8540,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "english": "All right, now we need to get\ngoing.",
      "_offset": 8568,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "english": "Huh? Mimi?",
      "_offset": 8605,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "english": "Sorry, Sora... I can't go.",
      "_offset": 8616,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "english": "You're not coming? You want to\nstay here?",
      "_offset": 8643,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "english": "Yeah. I... I don't want to see\nanyone else get hurt.",
      "_offset": 8685,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "english": "I'll stay behind, too.",
      "_offset": 8742,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "english": "Joe?",
      "_offset": 8765,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "english": "It's dangerous for Mimi to be here\nby herself... I'll try to persuade\nher. Is that okay?",
      "_offset": 8770,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "english": "All right. We're counting on you,\nJoe!",
      "_offset": 8859,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "english": "And we just got all eight of them\ntogether...",
      "_offset": 8898,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "english": "You don't understand, do you?",
      "_offset": 8944,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 8974,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "english": "The roads we take are different,\nbut our destination is the same,\neven with some thorns in the road.",
      "_offset": 8979,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "english": "It's for T.K's sake, too... I\ncan't just leave myself like\nthis...",
      "_offset": 9080,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "english": "We have to find Matt...",
      "_offset": 9150,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}